         <SecondaryPreamble>
            <EnactingText>
               <Para>
                  <Text>The Secretary of State, in exercise of the powers conferred by section 15(1), (2), and (3)(a) of, and paragraphs 1(1)(a) and (c), 1(2) and 5 of Schedule 3 to, the Health and Safety at Work etc. Act 1974<FootnoteRef Ref="f00001"/>, makes the following Regulations.</Text>
               </Para>
            </EnactingText>
         </SecondaryPreamble>
